      "content": "idk i feels like i cant focus on eating anything right now... my hands are shaking too much to even grab juice. i'm just really worried that if i don't take the insulin i'll just end up spiking again like i was earlier. won't a tiny bit just keep me in the middle ground? i'm pretty sure i just need to balance out that 180 from before. can't i just do a half unit?",
